id: "E597"
title: "conandata.yml sources 带 filename 键时配方 get() 再传 filename 关键字冲突（TypeError）"
trigger_tool: "conan"
phase: "source"
error_signature: "TypeError: get() got multiple values for keyword argument 'filename'|got multiple values for keyword argument 'filename'|Error in source() method"
severity: "2"
category: "conan, recipe, conandata, packaging"
match_keywords: "multiple values for keyword argument,conandata.yml,filename,get(),source() method,TypeError,strip_root"
title_en: "conandata sources filename key conflicts with explicit filename kwarg in get()"
root_cause: "conandata.yml 的 sources 段自带 filename 键（url/sha256/filename 三键形态，用于避免 Conan 对无扩展名/镜像 URL 的归档格式误判）时，配方 source() 里再显式写 filename=<名字> 会让 get(self, **self.conan_data[\"sources\"], filename=...) 展开出两个同名关键字，Python 调用绑定立即抛 TypeError；构建尚未开始，报错点在 source() 首行，极易被误判为 conandata 字段名拼写或 conan 版本问题。"
affected_scope: "所有在 conandata.yml sources 段写 filename 键、同时配方 source() 显式传 filename 的 Conan 包；libyal 族同款模板复制改写时最易触发。"
verification_cmd: "python3 -c \"from conan.tools.files import get; d={'url':'u','sha256':'s','filename':'a.tar.gz'}; get(None, **d, filename='b.tar.gz', strip_root=True)\" —— 设备直接执行即复现同型 TypeError（不联网、不建文件）；修复形态同命令去掉第二个 filename 后返回 TypeError: 'NoneType' 对象不可调用之前的正常参数绑定（不再报 multiple values）。"
rec_priority: "1"
rec_approach: "conandata-single-source-of-truth-for-get-kwargs"
rec_description: "二选一并保持单一来源：①推荐——conandata.yml 保留 url/sha256/filename 三键，配方写成 get(self, strip_root=True, **self.conan_data[\"sources\"])，不在调用点重复任何键（libfsapfs/20240429 先例）；②conandata 只留 url/sha256，配方显式传 filename=<名字>。改完用 py_compile 与 yaml.safe_load 双自检，再进采信轮。"
rec_command: "python3 -m py_compile <conanfile.py> && python3 -c \"import yaml; yaml.safe_load(open('<conandata.yml>'))\""
rec_auto_fix: "False"
rec_impl: "remove-duplicate-filename-kwarg"
fallback_priority: "2"
fallback_approach: "drop-filename-from-conandata"
fallback_description: "若模板必须保留调用点 filename=（如归档名与 URL 末段不一致），则从 conandata.yml sources 删除 filename 键，仅由配方持有归档名。"
fallback_command: "None"
fallback_auto_fix: "False"
fallback_impl: "conandata-without-filename-key"
forbid_1_pattern: "get\\(\\s*self,.*filename\\s*=.*\\*\\*self\\.conan_data|get\\(\\s*self,.*\\*\\*self\\.conan_data.*filename\\s*="
forbid_1_reason: "conandata sources 的 filename 键与调用点 filename 关键字同源，二者并存必然 TypeError；prescan 命中即配方缺陷，无需等构建失败。"
forbid_1_consequence: "conan create 在 source() 阶段立即失败（G2 FAIL），采信轮拿不到任何构建证据。"
principles: "配置数据与调用关键字不重复持有；conandata.yml 是 get() 参数的单一事实来源。"
causes: "[]"
caused_by: "[]"
similar_to: "E549, E007, E011"
conflicts_with: "[]"
prerequisite_of: "[]"
doc_file: "knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-E597-libsmraw-get-filename-duplicate-kwarg.md"
last_updated: "2026-09-20"
source_event: "libsmraw 20240506 全新包移植首轮 conan-verify G2 FAIL：TypeError: get() got multiple values for keyword argument 'filename'；对照 libfsapfs/20240429 同款三键形态的正确写法后修复，第二轮采信轮全绿"
authors: "libsmraw-20240506 任务"
source_pr: "None"
source_commit: "None"
metrics_success_count: "1"
metrics_fail_count: "0"
metrics_confidence: "1.0"
metrics_last_used: "2026-09-20"
draft: "True"
contributor_id: "libsmraw-20240506"
prescan_pattern: "get\\(\\s*self,.*filename\\s*=.*\\*\\*self\\.conan_data|get\\(\\s*self,.*\\*\\*self\\.conan_data.*filename\\s*="
